        "id": 199245,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-22T14:54:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Finally beat it, took probably 8 tries.I hate to say it, but you just have to get lucky. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Don't exactly have to have the precise cards in hand to win, but things need to line up just right regardless.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>yeah, I nearly threw my tablet out the window after a late game, fully set up, can't afford to get rid of most of this, can't afford not to, Devious Disruption.</p>\n<p>This particular one really reinforces my loathing for Randomized Start One-Shots.&nbsp; This Team really isn't built for this challenge.</p>",
