      {
        "id": 199246,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-22T15:09:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Blackfang108\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Blackfang108:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>TakeWalker wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Finally beat it, took probably 8 tries.I hate to say it, but you just have to get lucky. :/ Don't exactly have to have the precise cards in hand to win, but things need to line up just right regardless.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nyeah, I nearly threw my tablet out the window after a late game, fully set up, can't afford to get rid of most of this, can't afford not to, Devious Disruption.This particular one really reinforces my loathing for Randomized Start One-Shots.&nbsp; This Team really isn't built for this challenge.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This team is built for it otherwise no one would be completing it. &nbsp; Any four hero team in this same environment is likely going to have the same difficulty. &nbsp;</p>",
