        "created_at": "2017-06-22T18:33:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A team with more reliable ongoing control, more damage mitigation, and/or more damage output would do better. &nbsp;Swap GI Bunker for F6 Bunker, F6 Tempest for PW Tempest, and AZ for just about anyone with less setup (<span>AZ can be great in this fight, but he's too random)&nbsp;</span><span>and this would be more consistently winnable.</span></p>",
