      {
        "id": 199250,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-23T05:41:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Three of the four have some ongoing destruction. GI Bunker busts BB’s DR like nobody’s business. AZ can turn the Baron’s recurring Fire damage into revenge, or nullify it completely on himself. Fanatic can nuke, damage, and tank, and Tempest is a strong damage dealer.  This doesn’t seem like a poorly suited team to me.</p>",
