      {
        "id": 199251,
        "name": "waedens",
        "username": "waedens",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-23T14:04:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near mint - First game was over quickly with a tough draw like others encountered. Second game was a good with only AZ incapped (walked the razors edge on hp and paid the price) all other heroes in the teens. Never saw wrathful retribution (which is the game breaker in the setup), but was able to just wear him down.</p>",
