      {
        "id": 199252,
        "name": "Reverend Pete",
        "username": "Reverend_Pete",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-24T21:25:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tempest went down quickly, targeted by a Kraken at least once. Absolute Zero went down right after the flip, but had helped make the flip happen by turning the exploding bombs into cold damage to Blade. After the flip, Fanatic dealt a 31 damage Wrathful Retribution, then went down to the backlash field. Bunker, with 2HP reamianing, finished Blade off on AZ's incap turn with a Flak Cannon--taking Blade out before the backlash field kicked in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bunker used Foam Grenades a few times--pretty sure that's why victory was achieved.</p>",
