      {
        "id": 199257,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-03T23:48:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I found AZ to often be my most reliable source of damage. &nbsp;Though really all you've done is prove yourself wrong that just a couple of team tweaks make this matchup all that much easier. &nbsp;Ruins of Atlantis makes or breaks this game for the heroes more than what Blade does. &nbsp; Backlash Field early on certainly hurts but Atlantis is what gives this game more difficulty. &nbsp;</p>",
